Because the GPL-2.0-or-later DSP is compiled into the game executable, an
executable built from this repository is distributed (if at all) under the
GPL-2.0-or-later as a whole. This repository never distributes executables:
you build your own, from your own copy of the game.

Blood Wake itself, its code, art, sound, music and text, belongs to its
